# Train 5: p5-lifecycle-osc-compact in a session that claims truecolor (COLORTERM=truecolor, as the
# `-tc` twins on main): the frames osc.py reads, every grey as each product spells it
# under truecolor. Captured from a scratch copy of the scenario directory
# (FXCAP_SCENARIOS); not a scenario of the repository. The rest is the twin's:
# Phase 5 L-U1: OSC 7501 around a manual /compact. Nothing to compact first
# (no report), then a real compaction (working, then done).
env COLORTERM=truecolor
gateway p5-lifecycle-compactok-turns.json
work compact-ws
xfx: env XFX_SOUND=off
wait 4
type /compact
key Enter
wait 2
wire c00-noop
type first question
key Enter
wait 3
type second question
key Enter
wait 2.5
wire c01-answered
type /compact
key Enter
wait 4
wire c02-compacted
